    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Directions with 来 and 去",
     "texto": [
      "**来** shows movement toward the speaker; **去**, movement away. With a verb, the complements **进来/进去** mean «come in (here)/go in (there)» and **出来/出去**, «come out (here)/go out (there)».",
      "**上来、上去、下来、下去** apply the same idea to going up and down. **起来** can mean «to get up» or «to rise»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
